{"id":"metal","lemma":"metal","pos":"noun","rank":1695,"glosses":["metal (any of a number of elements that form a metallic bond with other metal atoms)","metal (any of a number of a number of hard but malleable materials consisting of metallic atoms)","money; wealth; riches"],"ipa":"/meˈtaw/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"metais"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-metal.wav","examples":[{"text":"O ouro é um metal.","en":"Gold is a metal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/841629","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"gold"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"É uma caixa de metal.","en":"It's a metal box.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"box"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Isto é feito de madeira ou de metal?","en":"Is this made out of wood or metal?","words":[null,null,{"g":"like"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"wood"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that is"]]},{"text":"O ferro é um metal.","en":"Iron is a metal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/841005","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"iron"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ambas as peças são de metal.","en":"Both pieces are made of metal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64276","words":[{"g":"both","l":"ambos"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"piece","l":"peça"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}